{"id":"185262","t":{"th":"HELL MODE อยากเล่นโหด ขอโหมดนรก","ro":"Hell Mode: Yarikomi-zuki no Gamer wa Haisettei no Isekai de Musou Suru","en":"HELL MODE: The Hardcore Gamer Dominates in Another World with Garbage Balancing","na":"ヘルモード ～やり込み好きのゲーマーは廃設定の異世界で無双する～"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx185262-95wbx3Y9hCwm.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx185262-95wbx3Y9hCwm.jpg","color":"#bbe450","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185262-6EExIkvGk1dI.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":23,"season":"WINTER","year":2026,"start":"2026-01-10","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"score":72,"pop":58468,"studio":"Yokohama Animation Lab","desc":"Thirty-five-year-old Kenichi Yamada has spent his life playing every single MMORPG he can get his hands on. Tired of new games that cater to casual players, he leaps at the chance to try out a never-ending game with an intimidating “Hell Mode” that raises the difficulty (and chances to level up) to impossible heights. But, as soon as he selects the “Summoner,” Kenichi finds himself transported into the world of the game and reborn to a family of serfs as a baby named Allen! With nothing but his memories and wits to guide him, Allen sets off to conquer Hell Mode, unearth the secrets of the Summoner class, and free his newfound family from their fate.","descTh":"Kenichi Yamada วัยสามสิบห้าปีใช้ชีวิตไปกับการเล่นเกม MMORPG ทุกเกมที่เขาสามารถทำได้ ด้วยความเบื่อหน่ายกับเกมใหม่ๆ ที่รองรับผู้เล่นทั่วไป เขาจึงกระโดดคว้าโอกาสที่จะลองเล่นเกมที่ไม่มีวันจบสิ้นด้วย \"โหมดนรก\" ที่น่าสะพรึงกลัว ซึ่งจะเพิ่มความยาก (และโอกาสในการเพิ่มเลเวล) ไปสู่ความสูงที่เป็นไปไม่ได้ แต่ทันทีที่เขาเลือก \"ซัมมอนเนอร์\" เคนอิจิก็พบว่าตัวเองถูกพาเข้าสู่โลกแห่งเกมและเกิดใหม่สู่ครอบครัวทาสในฐานะเด็กน้อยที่ชื่ออัลเลน! เมื่อไม่มีอะไรนอกจากความทรงจำและความเฉลียวฉลาดที่จะนำทางเขา อัลเลนจึงออกเดินทางเพื่อพิชิตโหมดนรก ค้นพบความลับของคลาสซัมมอนเนอร์ และปลดปล่อยครอบครัวที่เพิ่งค้นพบของเขาจากชะตากรรมของพวกเขา","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"CjO1Bo297N4","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/185262","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/60460","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"iqiyi","r":"TH","u":"https://www.iq.com/album/hell-mode-%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%94-%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81-2025-2gmdfjydkip?lang=th_th","lang":"sub","eps":[["12","https://www.iq.com/play/hell-mode-%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%94-%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81-ep-12-1haedqwv9ro?lang=th_th",1774458000,"d","q:6/20260327/04/36/v_195830907_m_601_zh-CN_m1",null,{"d":1425,"a":"vip","fin":1}],["11","https://www.iq.com/play/hell-mode-%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%94-%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81-ep-11-2g9r4ala3k4?lang=th_th",1774026000,"d","q:8/20260320/38/5e/v_195525731_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1425,"a":"vip"}],["10","https://www.iq.com/play/hell-mode-%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%94-%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81-ep-10-12ew3xbj9wc?lang=th_th",1773162000,"d","q:1/20260311/bf/33/v_195066628_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1425,"a":"vip"}],["9","https://www.iq.com/play/hell-mode-%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%94-%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%81-ep-9-idtpb05y1g?lang=th_th",1772557200,"d","q:2/20260304/90/7d/v_194681106_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1425,"a":"vip"}],["8","https://www.iq.com/play/hell-mode-%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%